        "text": "You've heard of doggy bags, but this party calls for a piggy bag! Pack up treats or leftovers for guests in cute gable boxes with farm-themed stickers — like these ones that say \"pig out!\" The red bandana is a fun bonus favor for budding cowboys and cowgirls.",
